---
description: 
globs: *.vue,*.tsx,*.ts
alwaysApply: false
---
Please prioritize code quality and strictly adhere to the following guidelines:

1. Minimize code duplication as much as possible.
   1. Extract types used multiple times into shared Type definitions.
   2. Encapsulate repeatedly used component code into reusable generic components.
2. Avoid bloated components with excessive logic. You must achieve this by extracting logic into custom Vue Composables or by splitting the UI into smaller sub-components.
3. Demonstrate proficiency with the Vue Composition API when implementing Vue components.
